---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: legionOperator calls transferInvestorPosition(from, to)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is legionOperator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period still active for source investor
    q_check_refund --> q_check_target: refund period completed
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_target --> q_revert_target: target address already has a position
    q_check_target --> q_transfer_pos: target address has no existing position
    q_revert_target --> [*]: revert TargetPositionExists
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_source: positions[to] = positions[from]
    q_clear_source --> q_emit: delete positions[from]
    q_emit --> [*]: emit InvestorPositionTransferred(from, to)

    note right of q_transfer_pos
        INV-001: Position transfer only after sale ended + refund period completed
        INV-002: Target address must not have an existing position (no merge)
        INV-003: All position data transferred: investedCapital, cachedInvestAmount, cachedTokenAllocationRate, flags, vestingAddress
        INV-004: Source position is deleted after transfer
    end note
